+ * 才能继续处理后面的 VMState.
+ *
+ *
+ * 最常见的实际流像这样:
+ *
+ * MEM_SIZE
+ *   -> RAMBlock "pc.ram", 16G
+ *
+ * PAGE
+ *   -> "pc.ram", GPA 0x1000, 4KB data
